# Normalize line endings: Git stores text with LF and checks it out with LF on
# every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored trees (test corpora, machine-readable grammars) are exempt from
# GitHub language stats and collapse in diffs. Extend the list when a new
# vendored tree lands (see .claude/rules/vendored-inputs.md).
# vendor/** linguist-vendored
# crates/*/vendor/** linguist-vendored
